<title>USA: Dow industrials open lower.</title>
<headline>Dow industrials open lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials headed lower at the start of trade Monday in sympathy with bonds as concern about a possible interest rate hike permeated markets.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials average was down 10 at 9256.</p>
</text>
